and-control, reverse shell, or interactive execution behavior is observed.\\n   - OR the alert lacks context for critical operations and cannot be correlated with trusted service accounts or historical benign activity.\"}, {\"step_id\": 7, \"task\": \"Generate Investigation Summary\", \"action\": \"Construct a concise Description field including: 1) Script intent, 2) VT and AbuseIPDB results, if they exist, and 3) Final reasoning.\", \"logic\": \"Ensures the summary explicitly clarifies whether the triage was based on a physical file path or script behavior alone.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-4104\", \"alert_name\": \"Suspicious PowerShell Script Execution\", \"start_time\": \"2025-12-21T15:39:16.000Z\", \"source_ip\": \"10.0.0.1\", \"endpoint\": \"HOST-01\", \"user\": \"SYSTEM\", \"user_id\": \"S-1-5-18\", \"description\": \"A suspicious PowerShell script was executed on the host.\", \"evidence\": {\"scriptblock\": \"[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8; $ProgressPreference = 'SilentlyContinue'\\n\\n# Helper function to handle null values and escape special characters\\nfunction HandleString($value) {\\n    if ($null -eq $value) { \\n        return \\\"-\\\" \\n    } else { \\n        return $value -replace '\\\"', '\\\\\\\"'  # Escape double quotes\\n    }\\n}\\n\\ntry {\\n    $ouList = @()\\n    $domain = HandleString((Get-ADDomainController).Forest)\\n    $properties = @(\\\"Name\\\", \\\"ManagedBy\\\", \\\"Created\\\", \\\"Modified\\\", \\\"DistinguishedName\\\", \\\"ObjectGUID\\\", \\\"isCriticalSystemObject\\\")\\n\\n    $linkedOu = @{}\\n    foreach ($gpi in Get-ADOrganizationalUnit -Filter * | Get-GPInheritance) {\\n        if ($null -eq $gpi) {\\n            continue\\n        }\\n        $linkedGPO = @()\\n        foreach ($lgpo in $gpi.GpoLinks) {\\n            $linkedGPO += @{\\n                \\\"name\\\" = HandleString($lgpo.DisplayName)\\n                \\\"enabled\\\" = $lgpo.Enabled\\n                \\\"enforced\\\" = $lgpo.Enforced\\n            }\\n        }\\n        try {\\n            foreach ($lgpo in $gpi.InheritedGpoLinks) {\\n                $linkedGPO += @{\\n                    \\\"name\\\" = HandleString($lgpo.DisplayName)\\n                    \\\"enabled\\\" = $lgpo.Enabled\\n                    \\\"enforced\\\" = $lgpo.Enforced\\n                }\\n            }\\n        }\\n        catch {\\n        }\\n        $linkedOu[$gpi.name] = $linkedGPO\\n    }\\n\\n    foreach ($o in Get-ADOrganizationalUnit -Filter \\\"*\\\" -Properties $properties) {\\n        if ($null -eq $o) {\\n            continue\\n        }\\n        if ($o.DistinguishedName -notlike '*OU=*') {\\n            continue\\n        }\\n        $empty = $false\\n        if (-not (Get-ADObject -SearchBase $o -SearchScope OneLevel -Filter *)) {\\n            $empty = $true\\n        }\\n\\n        $ouIsCritical = if ($null -ne $o.isCriticalSystemObject) { $o.isCriticalSystemObject } else { $false }\\n\\n        $linkedComputers = @()\\n        foreach ($computer in Get-ADComputer -SearchBase $o.DistinguishedName -Filter *) {\\n            $linkedComputers += HandleString($computer.Name)\\n        }\\n\\n        $linkedGroups = @()\\n        foreach ($group in Get-ADGroup -SearchBase $o.DistinguishedName -Filter *) {\\n            $linkedGroups += HandleString($group.Name)\\n        }\\n\\n        $linkedUsers = @()\\n        foreach ($user in Get-ADUser -SearchBase $o.DistinguishedName -Filter *) {\\n            $linkedUsers += HandleString($user.Name)\\n        }\\n\\n        $ouList += @{\\n            \\\"domain\\\" = $domain\\n            \\\"ou\\\" = HandleString($o.Name)\\n            \\\"name\\\" = HandleString($o.Name)\\n            \\\"managedBy\\\" = HandleString($o.ManagedBy)\\n            \\\"modifiedwhen\\\" = $o.Modified.ToString(\\\"dd-MM-yyyy HH:mm:ss\\\")\\n            \\\"createdwhen\\\" = $o.Created.ToString(\\\"dd-MM-yyyy HH:mm:ss\\\")\\n            \\\"distinguishedName\\\" = HandleString($o.DistinguishedName)\\n            \\\"objectguid\\\" = HandleString($o.ObjectGUID)\\n            \\\"empty\\\" = $empty\\n            \\\"gplink\\\" = $linkedOu[$o.Name]\\n            \\\"iscriticalsystemobject\\\" = $ouIsCritical\\n            \\\"linkedComputers\\\" = $linkedComputers\\n            \\\"linkedGroups\\\" = $linkedGroups\\n            \\\"linkedUsers\\\" = $linkedUsers\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    $jsonResult = $ouList | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 5\\n\\n    # Define primary and fallback paths\\n    $primaryPath = \\\"C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\CyberCNSAgent\\\\agent_temp\\\\ad_ous.json\\\"\\n    $fallbackPath = \\\"C:\\\\Windows\\\\cybercnsagent\\\\agent_temp\\\\ad_ous.json\\\"\\n\\n    # Get directory paths\\n    $primaryDir = Split-Path $primaryPath -Parent\\n    $fallbackDir = Split-Path $fallbackPath -Parent\\n\\n    # Determine final path\\n    if (Test-Path $primaryDir) {\\n        $finalPath = $primaryPath\\n    } else {\\n        # Ensure fallback directory exists\\n        if (-not (Test-Path $fallbackDir)) {\\n            New-Item -Path $fallbackDir -ItemType Directory -Force | Out-Null\\n        }\\n        $finalPath = $fallbackPath\\n    }\\n\\n    # Ensure directory exists before writing\\n    $finalDir = Split-Path $finalPath -Parent\\n    if (-not (Test-Path $finalDir)) {\\n        New-Item -Path $finalDir -ItemType Directory -Force | Out-Null\\n    }\\n\\n    # Save JSON result\\n    $jsonResult | Out-File -FilePath $finalPath -Encoding UTF8\\n\\n    Write-Output $jsonResult\\n}\\ncatch {\\n    ConvertTo-Json -Depth 5 -Compress @{\\n        status = $false\\n        msg = $( $_.Exception.Message )\\n        stackTrace = $_ | Out-String\\n    }\\n}\", \"os\": \"Windows Server 2022 Datacenter\"}, \"technique\": {\"name\": \"System Owner/User Discovery\", \"killchain_stage\": \"Discovery\"}}"
  }
]

