    "role": "user",
    "content": "Playbook: {\"playbook_name\": \"Excessive Download Triage\", \"description\": \"SOP for triaging data exfiltration or bulk download anomalies. Focuses on geolocation validation, user role correlation via email lookup, and file path sensitivity analysis.\", \"steps\": [{\"step_id\": 1, \"task\": \"Extract Alert Metadata & Evidence\", \"action\": \"Parse alert JSON for 'user' (email), 'source_ip', 'user_agent', 'workload', 'sample_files', 'sample_paths', and 'geo_location'.\", \"logic\": \"Establishes the scope of the download activity. Identifying the workload (e.g., SharePoint vs. OneDrive) and the nature of the files is the first step in assessing sensitivity.\"}, {\"step_id\": 2, \"task\": \"Geographic Context Validation\", \"action\": \"Evaluate the 'geo_location' field from the alert metadata.\", \"logic\": \"If the country is within Europe (e.g., Estonia), the risk level is lower. If the location is outside of Europe or represents a known 'impossible travel' scenario for the user, risk is higher unless the user is known to be working from that location.\"}, {\"step_id\": 3, \"task\": \"User Role & Identity Correlation\", \"action\": \"Invoke 'lookup_users' using the 'user' (email) provided in the alert. In some cases, the user may not be found; this is acceptable and you should continue with the investigation.\", \"tool_integration\": \"lookup_users\", \"logic\": \"Compare the user's job title/department with the 'sample_paths'.\"}, {\"step_id\": 4, \"task\": \"Historical & Environmental Correlation\", \"action\": \"MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'get_recent_events' and 'get_recent_similar_alerts' to understand context of the alert.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Determine if this volume of activity is a recurring pattern for this user or there is historical context that justifies the downloads (e.g., ongoing project work). This can be otherwise if the user has been flagged in recent alerts unusual behavior.\"}, {\"step_id\": 5, \"task\": \"User-Agent & Application Analysis\", \"action\": \"Examine the 'user_agent' and 'application' fields to identify the access method.\", \"logic\": \"Differentiate between browser-based downloads (manual), sync clients (automated/OneDrive).\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Final Triage Classification\", \"action\": \"Assign triage priority (LP or HP) based on the alignment of role, location, and data sensitivity.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - Geolocation is within Europe.\\n   - AND the user's role (via lookup_users) matches the sensitivity and department of the 'sample_paths'.\\n   - OR historical events show this is a recurring, authorized business process.\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - Geolocation is outside of Europe or anomalous for the user.\\n   - OR there is a significant mismatch between user role and file sensitivity (e.g., non-executive accessing Board minutes).\\n   - OR the download volume is drastically higher than the 24-hour baseline (20x and more) without a clear business justification.\"}, {\"step_id\": 7, \"task\": \"Generate Investigation Summary\", \"action\": \"Construct a summary including: 1) User role vs. data sensitivity, 2) Geolocation status, 3) Correlation with recent alerts, and 4) Final priority reasoning.\", \"logic\": \"Provides a clear narrative for SOC analysts to decide on client notification, further investigation or no action.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-12200\", \"alert_name\": \"Data Exfiltration Anomaly\", \"start_time\": \"2026-01-31T14:45:10.000Z\", \"source_ip\": \"194.126.101.99\", \"destination_ip\": \"40.108.201.15\", \"endpoint\": \"WKSTN-OFFSITE-04\", \"user\": \"Liam.O-Sullivan@globalcorp.ee\", \"user_id\": \"b11d99a4-e55c-4a12-b9a1-4f8c2d1f9a7b\", \"description\": \"An unusual volume of SharePoint file downloads (850) was observed from the user, which is higher than their 24-hour baseline.\", \"evidence\": {\"workload\": \"SharePoint\", \"operation\": \"FileDownloaded\", \"site_url\": \"https://globalcorp.sharepoint.com/sites/Executive_Board_Confidential/\", \"application\": \"Office 365 SharePoint Online\", \"user_agent\": \"Mozilla/4.0 (compatible; Win32; WinHttp.WinHttpRequest.5)\", \"file_count\": 850, \"baseline_24h\": 5, \"geo_location\": {\"city\": \"Tallinn\", \"country\": \"Estonia\"}, \"sample_files\": [\"Project_Zeus_Merger_Terms_v4.pdf\", \"Q1_Shareholder_Divestment_Plan.xlsx\", \"Board_Meeting_Minutes_January.docx\"], \"sample_paths\": [\"Shared Documents/Strategy/Acquisitions/Zeus/\", \"Shared Documents/Finance/Shareholder_Relations/\", \"Shared Documents/Executive/Board_Minutes/\"]}}"
