"MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'get_recent_events' AND 'get_recent_similar_alerts' to understand host context.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Determine if the host has a history of similar volume spikes or communication with this root domain.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Final Correlation and Triage Decision\", \"action\": \"Evaluate the normalized domain age, decoded payload results, and the endpoint's role.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - The root domain is verified infrastructure.\\n   - AND the subdomains match known patterns (e.g., DNSSEC sentinel).\\n\\n2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - **Decoded payloads contain sensitive host data.**\\n   - OR the root domain is newly registered (< 30 days).\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-14568\", \"alert_name\": \"DNS Tunneling Anomaly\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-06T11:20:00.000Z\", \"source_ip\": \"10.200.15.44\", \"destination_ip\": \"104.21.41.202\", \"endpoint\": \"dev-linux-node-03\", \"description\": \"An anomalously large amount (412 Bytes) of tunneled, high-entropy traffic through DNS (domain: github-status.com) was observed.\", \"evidence\": {\"workload\": \"Network\", \"application\": \"DNS\", \"query_type\": \"TXT\", \"actual_bytes\": 412, \"typical_bytes\": 22, \"sample_queries\": [\"70-61-73-73-77-6f-72-64.github-status.com\", \"3d-53-74-72-6f-6e-67-21.github-status.com\", \"61-64-6d-69-6e-2d-64-62.github-status.com\", \"node-03.github-status.com\", \"health-check-01.github-status.com\"]}}"
