\": \"Azure Network Security Modification\", \"start_time\": \"2026-10-18T14:16:17.000Z\", \"description\": \"A suspicious Azure activity was detected. This detection was triggered by a rule with the following description:\\\"Identifies when a network security configuration is modified or deleted.\\\"\", \"evidence\": {\"workload\": \"Microsoft.Network\", \"operation\": \"MICROSOFT.NETWORK/NETWORKSECURITYGROUPS/WRITE\", \"resource_id\": \"/subscriptions/228e1d3b-9311-4477-8c1d-112233445566/resourceGroups/rg-nordic-prod-001/providers/Microsoft.Network/networkSecurityGroups/nsg-aks-prod-northeast\", \"correlation_id\": \"e512d1c1-42a1-4991-9921-1a2b3c4d5e6f\", \"result\": \"Started\", \"geo_location\": {\"region\": \"Norway East\", \"stamp\": \"FDWeb\"}, \"authorization_details\": {\"principal_id\": \"7f2a8c12-3391-4e1a-b672-9d3c11bc99a1\", \"principal_type\": \"ServicePrincipal\", \"role\": \"Contributor\", \"scope\": \"/subscriptions/228e1d3b-9311-4477-8c1d-112233445566/resourceGroups/rg-nordic-prod-001\"}, \"request_body\": \"{\\\"etag\\\":\\\"W/\\\\\\\"7fca213d-e405-424f-ae76-2e9771bb94de\\\\\\\"\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"/subscriptions/228e1d3b-9311-4477-8c1d-112233445566/resourceGroups/rg-nordic-prod-001/providers/Microsoft.Network/networkSecurityGroups/nsg-aks-prod-northeast\\\",\\\"location\\\":\\\"norwayeast\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"nsg-aks-prod-northeast\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"defaultSecurityRules\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"AllowVnetInBound\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"access\\\":\\\"Allow\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Inbound\\\",\\\"priority\\\":65000,\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"*\\\"}}],\\\"securityRules\\\":[{\\\"name\\\":\\\"SanctionBlocks\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"access\\\":\\\"Deny\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"RUS RegionBlock\\\",\\\"destinationAddressPrefix\\\":\\\"40.113.112.55\\\",\\\"destinationPortRanges\\\":[\\\"80\\\",\\\"443\\\"],\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Inbound\\\",\\\"priority\\\":499,\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"TCP\\\",\\\"sourceAddressPrefixes\\\":[\\\"2.56.24.0/22\\\",\\\"2.57.0.0/24\\\",\\\"5.1.41.0/24\\\",\\\"5.8.0.0/20\\\",\\\"5.16.0.0/14\\\",\\\"31.13.64.0/18\\\",\\\"31.28.192.0/19\\\",\\\"45.8.156.0/22\\\",\\\"46.17.40.0/21\\\",\\\"80.89.128.0/18\\\",\\\"81.19.64.0/19\\\",\\\"91.200.12.0/22\\\",\\\"92.242.0.0/18\\\",\\\"94.100.176.0/20\\\",\\\"95.161.0.0/17\\\",\\\"109.106.136.0/21\\\",\\\"176.10.0.0/16\\\",\\\"178.154.128.0/18\\\",\\\"185.129.100.0/22\\\",\\\"188.128.0.0/17\\\",\\\"193.19.164.0/22\\\",\\\"194.67.0.0/16\\\",\\\"195.208.0.0/16\\\",\\\"212.192.0.0/18\\\",\\\"213.180.192.0/19\\\"],\\\"provisioningState\\\":\\\"Succeeded\\\"}},{\\\"name\\\":\\\"k8s-azure-lb-allow\\\",\\\"properties\\\":{\\\"access\\\":\\\"Allow\\\",\\\"destinationAddressPrefix\\\":\\\"40.113.112.55\\\",\\\"destinationPortRanges\\\":[\\\"443\\\",\\\"80\\\"],\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Inbound\\\",\\\"priority\\\":502,\\\"protocol\\\":\\\"Tcp\\\",\\\"sourceAddressPrefix\\\":\\\"Internet\\\"}}],\\\"provisioningState\\\":\\\"Succeeded\\\"}}\"}}"
  }
