 files or secondary alerts within a -1 hour window of the primary detection.\"}, {\"step_id\": 5, \"task\": \"Network Infrastructure & C2 Validation\", \"action\": \"If the alert metadata or 'get_recent_events' contains external IPs or URLs, MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'check_ip_reputation'.\", \"tool_integration\": \"check_ip_reputation\", \"logic\": \"Presence of Tor onion resolution or communication with blacklisted domains used for payload hosting immediately escalates the alert to HP.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Final Triage Classification\", \"action\": \"Assign triage priority (LP or HP) based on the combined weight of file reputation, execution state, and environmental risk.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - The file is a known and utilized file. \\n   - OR similar file was confirmed by the client previosly as expected.\\n 2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - The file is a verified Trojan or Malware.\\n   - OR the file is 'Runtime Packed' and exhibits staging behavior.\\n   - OR the detection involves Defense Evasion or C2 communication.\\n   - OR the remediation status is 'Failed' or 'Partial'.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-29908\", \"alert_name\": \"Malware Prevention: Trojan:Win32/SparkOnSoft\", \"threat_display_name\": \"Trojan:Win32/SparkOnSoft!AMTB\", \"status\": \"new\", \"start_time\": \"2026-02-12T09:44:07.000Z\", \"description\": \"A high-risk Trojan masquerading was detected.\", \"alert_web_url\": \"https://security.microsoft.com/alerts/78369289\", \"evidence\": {\"endpoint\": \"WKSTN-912A\", \"source_ip\": \"10.45.20.114\", \"user\": \"m.tamm@client.ee\", \"file_name\": \"$RYRO9NW.exe\", \"file_path\": \"C:\\\\$Recycle.Bin\\\\S-1-12-1-4290317762-1184293048-956127341-2105834469\\\\$RYFO7NF.exe\", \"file_signer\": \"Hawk Integrated Inc.\", \"file_signature_issuer\": \"Sectigo Public Code Signing CA EV R36\", \"file_size\": \"9 MB\", \"file_sha256\": \"686d018c86c03165925ebd3773c622f182c93f54b98db9616bae86f5e8684e4c\", \"detection_engine\": \"Microsoft Defender Antivirus\", \"remediation_status\": \"quarantined\", \"remediation_result\": \"Success\"}}"
