er.\", \"tool_integration\": [\"get_recent_events\", \"get_recent_similar_alerts\"], \"logic\": \"Search for 'dropped' files or secondary alerts within a -1 hour window of the primary detection.\"}, {\"step_id\": 5, \"task\": \"Network Infrastructure & C2 Validation\", \"action\": \"If the alert metadata or 'get_recent_events' contains external IPs or URLs, MAKE SURE TO INVOKE 'check_ip_reputation'.\", \"tool_integration\": \"check_ip_reputation\", \"logic\": \"Presence of Tor onion resolution or communication with blacklisted domains used for payload hosting immediately escalates the alert to HP.\"}, {\"step_id\": 6, \"task\": \"Final Triage Classification\", \"action\": \"Assign triage priority (LP or HP) based on the combined weight of file reputation, execution state, and environmental risk.\", \"logic\": \"Classification rules:\\n\\n1. **Low Priority (LP)** if:\\n   - The file is a known and utilized file. \\n   - OR similar file was confirmed by the client previosly as expected.\\n 2. **High Priority (HP)** if:\\n   - The file is a verified Trojan or Malware.\\n   - OR the file is 'Runtime Packed' and exhibits staging behavior.\\n   - OR the detection involves Defense Evasion or C2 communication.\\n   - OR the remediation status is 'Failed' or 'Partial'.\"}]}\nAlert: {\"alert_id\": \"SOC-29900\", \"alert_name\": \"Trend Micro: Possible Data Encrypted for Impact\", \"threat_display_name\": \"Ransom.Win32.LOCKY.SMYABHD.note\", \"threat_family_name\": \"Locky Ransomware\", \"status\": \"new\", \"start_time\": \"2026-01-09T21:57:45.000Z\", \"description\": \"Ransomware detection on host HOST-01. Indicators include ransomware file detection, ransom note detection, and heuristic analysis suggesting possible data encryption for impact.\", \"alert_web_url\": \"https://portal.eu.xdr.trendmicro.com/index.html#/workbench/alerts/WB-20260109\", \"evidence\": {\"endpoint\": \"HOST-01\", \"source_ip\": \"10.20.5.245\", \"file_path\": \"C:\\\\Data\\\\Financials\\\\2025\\\\_RECOVER_INSTRUCTIONS.txt\", \"sha256\": \"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996db92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\", \"indicators\": [\"Ransomware File Detected\", \"Ransom Note Detection (Real-time Scan)\", \"Heuristic: Possible Data Encrypted for Impact\"], \"first_seen\": \"2026-01-09T16:02:01Z\", \"last_seen\": \"2026-01-09T21:55:16Z\", \"remediation_status\": \"quarantined\"}}"
